    authored.set("Now, R.H.S. = (dF⃗/dt) × G⃗ + F⃗ × (dG⃗/dt). The expressions dF⃗/dt = ĵ + 2tk̂, dG⃗/dt = î + eᵗĵ", [{"en": "Now, R.H.S. = (dF⃗/dt) × G⃗ + F⃗ × (dG⃗/dt). The expressions dF⃗/dt = ĵ + 2tk̂, dG⃗/dt = î + eᵗĵ", "ur": "اب دائیں طرف = (dF⃗/dt) × G⃗ + F⃗ × (dG⃗/dt)۔ عبارتیں dF⃗/dt = ĵ + 2tk̂، dG⃗/dt = î + eᵗĵ", "ps": "اوس ښي خوا = (dF⃗/dt) × G⃗ + F⃗ × (dG⃗/dt). عبارتونه dF⃗/dt = ĵ + 2tk̂، dG⃗/dt = î + eᵗĵ"}]);
